node observations | Observations | Xᵢ,Yᵢ,Tᵢ
node code | Treatment code | supplied ḡₙ(Xᵢ)
node residuals | Residuals | Zₙ,ᵢ=Tᵢ−ḡₙ(Xᵢ)
node pilot | Pilot fold | empirical transforms | select bank circle
node evaluation | Evaluation fold | normalized contour average | Ĝ/F̂ ratio
node clipping | Clipping | real midpoint | clip to [−Cθ,Cθ]
node represented | Represented data | bounded spectral adapter | same Borel statistic
node output | Output | θ̂_spec,n
edge observations -> residuals
edge code -> residuals
edge residuals -> pilot
edge residuals -> evaluation
edge pilot -> evaluation
edge evaluation -> clipping
edge clipping -> output
edge represented -> output
